WEBVTT

00:00:00.575 --> 00:00:01.289
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.222 --> 00:00:05.527
I<b>’ve cleaned</b> the fridge – it looks new!

00:00:07.057 --> 00:00:08.667
He <b>hasn’t done</b> the washing-up.

00:00:09.182 --> 00:00:10.510
Can you help me do it?

00:00:11.935 --> 00:00:13.791
<v><b>A:</b></v> The concert starts soon.

00:00:14.148 --> 00:00:15.745
<b>Have</b> you <b>turned</b> off your phone?

00:00:16.215 --> 00:00:17.427
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>I have</b>.

00:00:19.621 --> 00:00:20.261
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:21.336 --> 00:00:22.988
Mary<b>’s had</b> her baby!

00:00:24.533 --> 00:00:26.377
A parcel <b>has arrived</b> for you.